# Build output and caches. Everything here is reproducible from source.
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Packaged/

# Generated solution and IDE state
*.sln
*.suo
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Python bytecode from the content build
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Content is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# Every asset under Content/ and under each plugin's Content/ is generated by
# Tools/build_content.py, but the generated assets are committed so that a fresh clone
# builds and packages without first running a headless editor pass. Regenerate them at any
# time with the command in README.md; the build is deterministic and converges on the same
# result.
